</blockquote>
</blockquote>
<blockquote>-Code de la sécurité sociale. <blockquote>
Art. L412-8
</blockquote>
</blockquote>
<blockquote>-Code général des impôts, CGI. <blockquote>
Art. 302 bis F
</blockquote>
</blockquote>
</CONTENU>
